# text = Much as I hate the thing from my very soul , and much as I admire the consistency with which the ` Pulpit ' has opposed it , I myself am so much in want of support for my own little efforts , and am struggling so hard honestly to make for myself a remunerative career , that I think , were the opportunity offered to me , I should pocket my honour , lay aside the high feeling which tells me that praise should be bought neither by money nor friendship , and descend among the low things , in order that I might one day have the pride of feeling that I had succeeded by my own work in providing for the needs of my children .
